    "id": 6128,
    "title": "Problem 6128",
    "description": "Write a Python function called `find_pattern_from_1_while` that must find `pattern` starting at index 1, or return -1. Practice while loop syntax.\nDifficulty: Intermediate.\nExamples:\n  find_pattern_from_1_while(\"abracadabra\", \"a\") -> 3\n  find_pattern_from_1_while(\"hello\", \"ll\") -> 2",
    "initialCode": "def find_pattern_from_1_while(text, pattern):\n    pass",
