    "description": "Write a Python function called `cycle_position_1_while` that must advance 3 cyclic steps and return the final position. Practice while loop syntax.\nDifficulty: Expert.\nExamples:\n  cycle_position_1_while(0, 2, 5) -> 1\n  cycle_position_1_while(3, 1, 4) -> 2",
