    "description": "Write a Python function called `dict_merge_1` that must merge two dictionaries and store marker 1. Practice dictionary syntax.\nDifficulty: Easy.\nExamples:\n  dict_merge_1({\"a\": 1}, {\"b\": 2}) -> {\"a\": 1, \"b\": 2, \"marker\": 1}\n  dict_merge_1({\"x\": 1}, {\"x\": 9}) -> {\"x\": 9, \"marker\": 1}",
