    "description": "Write a Python function called `comp_conditional_1` that must square values above 1 and negate all others. Practice comprehension syntax.\nDifficulty: Intermediate.\nExamples:\n  comp_conditional_1([0, 1, 2]) -> [0, -1, 4]\n  comp_conditional_1([]) -> []",
